{"from":"1:1","body":"<p><ref to=\"HAB.1.1\">1</ref> Unto Habakkuk, complaining of the iniquity of the land,<br/><ref to=\"HAB.1.5\">5</ref> is shewn the fearful vengeance by the Chaldeans.<br/><ref to=\"HAB.1.12\">12</ref> He complains that vengeance should be executed by them who are far worse.<br/><br/><br/><ref to=\"ISA.22.1 NAM.1.1\">Isa 22:1; Na 1:1</ref></p>"}
