{"from":"3:16","body":"<p>I heard.<br/><ref to=\"HAB.3.2 HAB.1.5-HAB.1.11\">2; 1:5-11</ref><br/>my belly.<br/><ref to=\"PSA.119.120 JER.23.9 EZK.3.14 DAN.8.27 DAN.10.8\">Ps 119:120; Jer 23:9; Eze 3:14; Da 8:27; 10:8</ref><br/>that I.<br/><ref to=\"PSA.91.15 PSA.94.12 PSA.94.13 ISA.26.20 ISA.26.21 JER.15.10 JER.15.11 JER.45.3-JER.45.5 EZK.9.4-EZK.9.6\">Ps 91:15; 94:12,13; Isa 26:20,21; Jer 15:10,11; 45:3-5; Eze 9:4-6</ref><br/><ref to=\"2TH.1.6-2TH.1.9\">2Th 1:6-9</ref><br/>he will.<br/><ref to=\"HAB.1.6 DEU.28.49-DEU.28.52 2KI.24.1 2KI.24.2 JER.25.9-JER.25.11\">1:6; De 28:49-52; 2Ki 24:1,2; Jer 25:9-11</ref><br/>invade them. or cut them in pieces.</p>"}
{"from":"3:17","body":"<p>the fig-tree.<br/><ref to=\"DEU.28.15-DEU.28.18 DEU.28.30-DEU.28.41 JER.14.2-JER.14.8 JOL.1.10-JOL.1.13 JOL.1.16-JOL.1.18 AMO.4.6-AMO.4.10\">De 28:15-18,30-41; Jer 14:2-8; Joe 1:10-13,16-18; Am 4:6-10</ref><br/><ref to=\"HAG.2.16 HAG.2.17\">Hag 2:16,17</ref><br/>fail. Heb. lie.</p>"}
{"from":"3:18","body":"<p>I will rejoice.<br/><ref to=\"DEU.12.18 1SA.2.1 JOB.13.15 PSA.33.1 PSA.46.1-PSA.46.5 PSA.85.6 PSA.97.12 PSA.104.34\">De 12:18; 1Sa 2:1; Job 13:15; Ps 33:1; 46:1-5; 85:6; 97:12; 104:34</ref><br/><ref to=\"PSA.118.15 PSA.149.2 ISA.41.16 ISA.61.10 ZEC.10.7 LUK.1.46 LUK.1.47 ROM.5.2 ROM.5.3\">Ps 118:15; 149:2; Isa 41:16; 61:10; Zec 10:7; Lu 1:46,47; Ro 5:2,3</ref><br/><ref to=\"PHP.4.4 JAS.1.2 JAS.1.9 JAS.1.10 1PE.1.8 1PE.4.12 1PE.4.13\">Php 4:4; Jas 1:2,9,10; 1Pe 1:8; 4:12,13</ref><br/>the God.<br/><ref to=\"EXO.15.2 PSA.25.5 PSA.27.1 PSA.118.14 ISA.12.2 MIC.7.7 LUK.2.30\">Ex 15:2; Ps 25:5; 27:1; 118:14; Isa 12:2; Mic 7:7; Lu 2:30</ref></p>"}
{"from":"3:19","body":"<p>my strength.<br/><ref to=\"PSA.18.1 PSA.27.1 PSA.46.1 ISA.12.2 ISA.45.24 ZEC.10.12 2CO.12.9 2CO.12.10\">Ps 18:1; 27:1; 46:1; Isa 12:2; 45:24; Zec 10:12; 2Co 12:9,10</ref><br/><ref to=\"EPH.3.16 PHP.4.13 COL.1.11\">Eph 3:16; Php 4:13; Col 1:11</ref><br/>like.<br/><ref to=\"2SA.22.34 PSA.18.33\">2Sa 22:34; Ps 18:33</ref><br/>to walk.<br/><ref to=\"DEU.32.13 DEU.33.29 ISA.58.14\">De 32:13; 33:29; Isa 58:14</ref><br/>stringed instruments. Heb. Neginoth.<br/><ref to=\"PSA.4.1-PSA.4.8 PSA.6.1-PSA.6.10 PSA.54.1-PSA.54.7 PSA.55.1-PSA.55.23 PSA.67.1-PSA.67.7 PSA.76.1-PSA.76.12\">Ps 4:1-8; 6:1-10; 54:1-7; 55:1-23; 67:1-7; 76:1-12; *titles</ref></p>"}
